"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ أَعْلَمُ بِإِيمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>نِهِ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ‌ۖ فَإِنْ عَلِمْتُمُوهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ مُؤْمِنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">تٍ ف</span>َلَا تَرْجِعُوهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ إِلَى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكُفَّارِ‌ۖ لَا هُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ حِ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">لٌّ ل</span>َّهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحِلُّونَ لَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ‌ۖ وَءَاتُوه<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>ّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۚ</span> وَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ت</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نك</span>ِحُوهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ إِذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> ءَاتَيْتُمُوهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ أُجُورَهُ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َ‌ۚ وَلَا تُمْسِكُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> بِعِصَمِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَوَافِرِ وَسْــَٔلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> م<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>تُمْ وَلْيَسْــَٔلُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> م<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نف</span>َقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ‌ۚ</span> ذ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>لِكُمْ حُكْمُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ‌ۖ يَحْكُمُ بَيْنَكُمْ‌ۚ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ عَلِيمٌ حَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١٠</span>"},{"id":11,"tajweed":"وَإِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ف</span>َاتَكُمْ ش<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">َىْءٌ م</span>ِّنْ أَزْو<